      "text": "```\nHUTCHINSON'S NICHE HYPERVOLUME (1957)\n  Niche = n-dimensional hypervolume where a species can survive & reproduce\n  Each dimension = an environmental variable (temperature, food size, salinity, etc.)"
    },
